# 基本文章編集の文章の中の図形を、デスクトップの図形編集のウインドウへ運び出すのを、デスク
# トップの文章編集とプロセスの文章編集で同じにする (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. A copy of
# 画用紙 (mkbig fig) is opened with the desktop's figure editor and moved by its name band to the
# lower right of the screen. A copy of 基本文章編集 whose record 0 is a text with a figure standing
# in a line (xmlbig) is opened at 100,100, and the figure carried by the hand out of the window
# onto the figure, the button let go at once: it is put in the figure where its box is, and
# leaves the text (the process hands it on as a fragment in the tray's place of its own,
# DT_F_FRAG, and the desktop puts it in as from a text of its own, dd_frag_into_fig). Record 0 of
# the text, saved, and the figure's record (sum keys: the figure has the keys once it took the
# figure) are the same, byte for byte, whichever editor carried it; a second copy of 画用紙,
# opened and put over the first, is the one for the process.
# Keys: Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
figproc kernel
mkbig fig 3 1
open big
wait 1500
sync 600
drag 500 117 1000 412
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig doc 3
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document><text lang="0" bpat="0"/>
xml <p>先頭の行です。</p>
xml <p>前<bold>太字の語</bold>と<font color="#ff0000">赤い語</font>の後</p>
xml <p>A<figure><figView left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/><figDraw left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/><rect l_pat="1" left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/></figure>B</p>
xml <p>最後の行です。</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlbig
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
hold 160 225
move 300 300
move 700 450
move 1000 550
up
sync 600
wait 300
sum show keys
keep kernel_to
click 400 112
sync 600
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig fig 3 1
open big
wait 1500
sync 600
drag 500 117 1000 412
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig doc 3
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document><text lang="0" bpat="0"/>
xml <p>先頭の行です。</p>
xml <p>前<bold>太字の語</bold>と<font color="#ff0000">赤い語</font>の後</p>
xml <p>A<figure><figView left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/><figDraw left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/><rect l_pat="1" left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/></figure>B</p>
xml <p>最後の行です。</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlbig
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 4
wait 800
logmark
hold 160 225
move 300 300
move 700 450
move 1000 550
up
expectsincein 10 document: figure carried out (0)
wait 500
sum show keys
same kernel_to
logmark
click 400 112
wait 300
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince document: saved (0)
sum show
same kernel
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
wait 500
